{"id":112278720020914,"type":"artist","name":"Andrew Hill","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":15,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Andrew_Hill.jpg?width=500","bio":"Andrew Hill (Chicago, 30 de junio de 1937 - 20 de abril de 2007), fue un pianista y compositor estadounidense de jazz; encuadrado dentro de la vanguardia jazzística, es uno de los representantes del jazz modal y un explorador de las posibilidades rítmicas y armónicas del bop y del hard bop.\n\nComo compositor, fue autor de melodías laberínticas y de temas rítmica y armónicamente complejos como \"New Monastery\", dentro de su disco Point of Departure.","tags":["jazz","free jazz","Avant-Garde Jazz","piano","Avant-Garde"]},"works":[{"id":157336673795406,"type":"album","name":"Black Fire","artist":"Andrew Hill","year":1964,"weight":4,"yt":"MjojXBjg8Z0","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":56169400631168,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz — Post-Bop","rank":48,"scaruffi":null},{"id":127983995863234,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz","rank":183,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":118817956121166,"type":"album","name":"Judgment","artist":"Andrew Hill","year":1964,"weight":3,"yt":"01EwcflVvg0","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":56169400631168,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz — Post-Bop","rank":59,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":175786399412636,"type":"work","name":"Refuge","artist":"Andrew Hill","year":1964,"weight":6,"yt":"AZUHjOHsu9k","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Historia del jazz","title":"Historia del jazz (Ted Gioia)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":176047165201644,"type":"album","name":"Point of Departure","artist":"Andrew Hill","year":1965,"weight":16,"yt":"eQdttifZrv4","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Historia del jazz","title":"Historia del jazz (Ted Gioia)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":32093215757431,"name":"Pitchfork: The 200 Best Albums of the 1960s","rank":198,"scaruffi":null},{"id":1